      "text": "Figure 1, part 3 'Evaluation Pipeline': a PDF-Parser produces Parsed Text (TXT); together with Ground Truth (JSON list of text, inline-formula and display-formula items) it feeds 'LLM-Based Matching (+ Rule-Based Post-Verification)', which outputs Formula Pairs (JSON of gt_formula/parsed_formula, e.g. $a+1$ vs $a+I$) and then 'Evaluation for all formula pairs'.",
